<title>LATVIA: FINANCE MINISTRY TO SELL 28-DAY, 3-MO T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>FINANCE MINISTRY TO SELL 28-DAY, 3-MO T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The finance ministry said on Monday that it will this week offer 28-day and three month Treasury bills for sale at the Wednesday auction.</p>
<p>The ministry said in a statment that it will offer 500,000 lats of 28-day paper and one million lats of three-month paper.</p>
<p>The average yield for these maturities was 4.40 percent and 5.47 percent at last week's auction.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Lannin, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
